msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...Back to your question about the delivery. Yes, you can."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...Voltando à sua pergunta sobre as entregas. Sim você pode."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C685EEA4_AC83_46D8_8B2A_9813F2571154
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4bed8dc091b7e375c8363a19845be1220a82dc65117f1e362053b7a4bf09b5db
