msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C685EEA4_AC83_46D8_8B2A_9813F2571154"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I haven’t made any requests recently, but you can write what you want on a sheet of parchment"
"—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or, if we don’t have any, something similar—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫put it in the box, and leave it "
"outside."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não tenho feito nenhum pedido recentemente, mas você pode escrever o que quer em uma folha "
"de pergaminho—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ou, se não tivermos nenhuma, algo similar—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫botar na caixa e "
"deixar do lado de fora."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F1E93294_06F9_4B17_A090_3C9FD122604A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59ca0c323a2c32ba3145abfd1cacec0463682dad8f21c60c6b4bee55d8c4f61c
