msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As long as your request is not completely unreasonable,⟪k:1⟫it should arrive with the next "
"package.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Why, is there something you need?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Contanto que seu pedido não seja completamente irracional,⟪k:1⟫deve chegar com o próximo "
"pacote.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Por que, há algo que você precisa?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DA7B9844_485E_4F03_85FC_0841A86EE882
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
