msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Yeah, I was hoping to increase our selection of vegetables!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And while I’m at "
"it, if possible..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sim, eu esperava aumentar nossa seleção de vegetais!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫E falando nisso, se "
"possível..."

