msgid "⟪k:0⟫he at least seemed to be making an effort to close the gap."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫pelo menos parecia estar fazendo um esforço para fechar a lacuna."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6D3547AE_EDF0_4132_9288_C3FBD619F14A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ee30f5d1fd0239c23774ccd11c69de39f2a5a3b14ed3d84e1cdb2cf83c786e8
