msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6D3547AE_EDF0_4132_9288_C3FBD619F14A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He would, on occasion, tell me about himself—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫though not in much detail, and "
"anytime his family came up, he grimaced uncomfortably."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫De vez em quando, me contava sobre si mesmo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫embora não em muitos detalhes, e "
"sempre que chegava a sua família, ele fazia uma careta desconfortavelmente."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5D9B438E_9E68_4E35_8F6C_2E778FC3251C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8bc6e017aeca9d676e6d29f961943fba5ca638ce746fbe6306c804a5f45cf51e
#. default-sha256: 02b997667be48ff85bff4531732cc85d8984adc579a31bbc3c8a08cef87312d7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5D9B438E_9E68_4E35_8F6C_2E778FC3251C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Apparently, his father had wanted him dead."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Aparentemente, seu pai o queria morto."

#: scenario5:scenario5_19301F89_0C4E_4A94_B2F9_74ACE8871DE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7ca24df94c75e080631451076e4ebb35c17342743781513c4899b8a5eaf20e0
#. default-sha256: 31400bf15b727abba502dee229c731070b07d904a3a4dcf9b94735c959965e19
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_19301F89_0C4E_4A94_B2F9_74ACE8871DE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His brothers, though, had worked to create a scenario in which he could live, faking his "
"death and sending him to this remote mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seus irmãos, porém, trabalharam para criar um cenário em que ele pudesse viver, fingindo sua "
"morte e enviando-o para esta mansão remota."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5A68A665_39D6_4D33_9CFE_07F9D54E4349
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05621852a815b51fcfcf79c4618d78d684ea178d9524b165a05e6752e8f49c8b
#. default-sha256: 0640b9e900b89dff3ad0f9c225a3a35cc04d08dad8de8abe9959aa3d7e7eceeb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5A68A665_39D6_4D33_9CFE_07F9D54E4349"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had never encountered Michel’s brothers while at his family’s estate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu nunca tinha encontrado os irmãos de Michel enquanto estava na propriedade de sua família."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F237594D_9E48_4DC3_98F6_FB45C98AB6BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d272d9bf53e0faf4681dc8d779645fa937bacc3a48686c9436bf02d59ac858f1
#. default-sha256: 497dbba3aedbbcdd31259f6573719da6f29c8069553c1ca57d6e782755ca78a5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F237594D_9E48_4DC3_98F6_FB45C98AB6BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But assuming he was right and it was one of them who had given me that letter, they were "
"likely our only allies at that house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas assumindo que ele estava certo e foi um deles quem me mandou aquela carta, eles "
"provavelmente eram nossos únicos aliados naquela casa."

#: scenario5:scenario5_913D6AFA_9829_4FAB_925E_2C845ED7201F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec96058506d32cd24231c23a9d9a92567b3e8a2773c86ea568f1ae67c11b4b4a
#. default-sha256: 6eb6b9d201ad32a76325dbb1a89ceb4f66ecd808bbd62d18c07b77fe229bd99d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_913D6AFA_9829_4FAB_925E_2C845ED7201F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I don’t know what he’s thinking. It’s been ten years,”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Michel had muttered, ⟪k:3⟫"
"to which I had replied, ⟪k:4⟫“Have faith.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Não sei o que ele está pensando. Já se passaram dez anos”,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Michel havia murmurado, "
"⟪k:3⟫ao que eu respondi, ⟪k:4⟫“Tenha fé”."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FD24F619_1B8D_4FFC_BE52_2FCD51455CC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54095e7e30030624635158916a4855ab04947f1c266c9c345a86bfa738e27a7d
#. default-sha256: 6977572746e87b0edf2c6839df18e396fbc990ec68c6214ba998baa65ee36ada
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FD24F619_1B8D_4FFC_BE52_2FCD51455CC9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was better to believe in ⟪k:1⟫something⟪k:2⟫,⟪k:3⟫even if it felt silly and unreasonable,"
"⟪k:4⟫than to lose faith in everything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era melhor acreditar em ⟪k:1⟫algo⟪k:2⟫,⟪k:3⟫mesmo que pareça bobo e irracional,⟪k:4⟫do que "
"perder a fé em tudo."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0D065B95_6ECA_4733_AA0D_848FE1AA8859
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc9ba8e99a469b83cdcab346341161a7bc77d2bd9405ee694d59d3775024f523
#. default-sha256: 25c1e5e6e8ebba7f9a1080ce591867e610ab0dddf6d4a0a6b58163f4b37b2756
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0D065B95_6ECA_4733_AA0D_848FE1AA8859"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My being able to find renewed belief in the kindness of people...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫was what had "
"allowed me to start smiling again, after all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Minha capacidade de encontrar uma crença renovada na bondade das pessoas...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫foi o "
"que me permitiu começar a sorrir de novo, afinal."

#: scenario5:scenario5_15ECF28D_FA37_4808_8C6E_9115AEA4A2E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 776fc6fb6a2fa636d666b75204928ceb0011c67899d881adda6b877dd1e5fb96
#. default-sha256: 500541c30b781c4a67cb9deba09dd1bf77ba8a8f6e6f9b45cd3204f3a176b494
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_15ECF28D_FA37_4808_8C6E_9115AEA4A2E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Because I was able to have that faith, I was able to enjoy life once more."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Por ser capaz de ter essa fé, consegui aproveitar a vida mais uma vez."

#: scenario5:scenario5_4DB14F68_C71B_41DB_929A_EA8255CB3FB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 899a566e5ca23469a816bc8c0e61d27f5d7005587b91e1470e1c0a73e692133e
#. default-sha256: c46f3489e89e355ac54e012d7f4c9d63da6f09b3324b5c77a0a3878060d88e34
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4DB14F68_C71B_41DB_929A_EA8255CB3FB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It wasn’t an exciting or thrilling life; ⟪k:1⟫it was a humble, simple one with just the two "
"of us."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não era uma vida excitante ou emocionante; ⟪k:1⟫era humilde e simples, apenas nós dois."

#: scenario5:scenario5_84D5B7A5_D528_4F22_A744_3B58EC9C6ECA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6fa9738b4d9b27dab1258c868cb89d47090e877e0b1244db82ed8b0c9f78561
