msgid "⟪k:0⟫But I wouldn’t trade that light for anything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mas eu não trocaria essa luz por nada."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1CFD07EA_A58A_4A44_993F_45497DCEADC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52e54619f2b00da1186cb55720a4fd541aad45f64d138ee763533a28864add12
