msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D3609512_D91D_4932_8F85_593F0102A1AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That winter, the fireplace was never without a crackling blaze in its belly. ⟪k:1⟫The boiled "
"wine we drank was undoubtedly middling and cheap,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Naquele inverno, a lareira nunca ficava sem uma chama crepitante em seu ventre. ⟪k:1⟫O vinho "
"fervido que bebíamos era, sem dúvida, mediano e barato,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3E33F8FD_DBFD_4A8F_897B_7C6E3336E250
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dee274d952275a26e904efd956ea20a80203cb91f706e45da6252f2bd206581c
